<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-RESULTS OF THE ETOILE DE BESSEGES FIRST STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-RESULTS OF THE ETOILE DE BESSEGES FIRST STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>NIMES, France 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>143-km Etoile de Besseges cycling race first stage on Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Patrice Halgan (France) Festina  3 hours 13 minutes and 9</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Eros Poli (Italy) GAN</p>
<p>3. Bruno Boscardin (Italy) Festina</p>
<p>4. Rodolfo Massi (Italy) Casino</p>
<p>5. Laurent Roux (France) TVM</p>
<p> 6. Zbigniew Spruch (Poland) Mapei	  all same time</p>
<p> 7. Steven De Jongh (Netherlands)	   1:42 behind</p>
<p>8. Wim Feys (Belgium) Lotto</p>
<p>9. Ruben Galvan (Spain) Kelme</p>
<p> 10. Kris Gerits (Belgium) Vallandeeren    all same time</p>
<p>Leading overall standings</p>
<p> 1. Halgan			    3 hours 12 minutes and 59</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p> 2. Poli				 4 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Boscardin			  6</p>
<p> 4. Massi				8</p>
